  "goal": "Surpass the source-paper result on the same task: Predict the next sensory symbol in the original 2ACDC task sequences; retain the source reward-symbol prediction-accuracy comparison in Extended Data Fig. 9a. Hidden-state orthogonalization and Fig. 2f mouse learning curves are accompanying descriptive analyses, not substitutes for prediction performance.",
