    "Candidate method and outputs for the source task: Predict the next sensory symbol in the original 2ACDC task sequences; retain the source reward-symbol prediction-accuracy comparison in Extended Data Fig. 9a. Hidden-state orthogonalization and Fig. 2f mouse learning curves are accompanying descriptive analyses, not substitutes for prediction performance.",
    "Source-paper comparison for Original Extended Data Fig. 9a reward-symbol prediction accuracy under the source model-specific protocols: Higher reward-symbol prediction accuracy is the source endpoint in Extended Data Fig. 9a; next-input accuracy is described for transformer testing. Recover the exact correct-prediction numerator, eligible-position denominator, decision/tie rule and relation between these metrics before scoring. Cross-entropy training loss and hidden-state correlation cannot replace this accuracy."
  ],
  "success_criteria": [
